msgid ""
"<qt><p><b>Log window</b></p>\n"
"<p>In this window the output of the executed commands are shown.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p><b>Log venster</b></p>\n"
"<p>In hierdie venster die uitset van die uitgevoerde opdragte word "
